# Every checkout is byte-identical to the repository: no line-ending conversion, as in
# pdfcraft/.gitattributes, now for the whole workspace. Windows checkouts default to
# core.autocrlf=true, which rewrote the root Cargo.lock that PdfCraft's tests read, signed PDFs
# (breaking their signatures) and assets whose SHA-256 ATTRIBUTION.toml records.
* -text

# Not text at all: no textual diffs or merges either.
*.pdf binary
*.p12 binary
*.pfb binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.icc binary
*.icns binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.brotli binary
